SUMMARY:Fishing Tournament at Hagg Lake
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a community-wide fishing tourney! Brought to you by Get Hooked and Washington County Parks\, this family-friendly event is an opportunity to fish together and win fun prizes. \nJudging will be based on fish length\, and prizes will be awarded for youth and adults for the following species: trout\, brown bullhead\, bluegill\, crappie\, and perch. Ages 12 and under will be eligible for youth prize categories. Fishing is allowed from shoreline and boats. \nFees: $10/individual or $20/ per household (up to 4 people). Registration is required. Every participant must complete a waiver. Fees are non-transferable and non-refundable. \nEditor’s note: This event is a community submission.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/fishing-tournament-at-hagg-lake/
LOCATION:Hagg Lake\, 50250 SW Scoggins Valley Rd\, Gaston\, 97119\, United States
CATEGORIES:Active,Family Fun,Kids Calendar,Outdoor,Sports
