SUMMARY:Classic Diner Brunch Collab at Pal's - Hayden Island
DESCRIPTION:An iconic New England diner is popping up on Hayden Island for one weekend only. Join Pal’s for a Mother’s Day Weekend brunch collaboration with Greg Mitchell of the legendary Palace Diner in Biddeford\, Maine. Through exceptional spirit\, deep hospitality\, and seriously good cooking\, Greg and his team have built one of the most beloved diner brands around\, and now they’re serving it alongside an exceptional view of the Columbia River \n  \nSaturday\, May 9 + Sunday\, May 10 //  9 AM – 2 PM. Reservations can be made here. \n515 NE Tomahawk Island Dr.
URL:https://pdxparent.com/event-single/classic-diner-brunch-collab-at-pals-hayden-island/2026-05-09/
