SUMMARY:A Three-Course Celebration at JORY
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate mom the wine country way with a stunning brunch at JORY\, The Allison Inn & Spa’s signature restaurant. On Saturday and Sunday\, JORY offers a three-course Mother’s Day Weekend brunch menu featuring Smoked Salmon Quiche\, Lamb Ragout\, and Eggs Benedict.  A celebratory French Toast breakfast is available for children under 12. Elevate the special day with a stroll through the sculpture garden. \n  \nSaturday\, May 9 + Sunday\, May 10 //  9 AM – 2 PM \n$55 per person\, à la carte also available // Reservations can be made here. \n2525 Allison Lane\, Newberg // @allisoninnspa
